        "answer": "查询到销售额最高的艺术家是 Iron Maiden（artist_id=90），明细销售额为 33.66（数据库金额单位）。\n\nIron Maiden（铁娘子乐队）是英国重金属乐队，由贝斯手及主要创作者 Steve Harris 于1975年在伦敦东部的 Leyton 组建[E1]。乐队是英国重金属新浪潮的重要代表；其音乐和歌词涉及历史、文学、战争、神话及科幻等题材[E1]。同名首张录音室专辑于1980年发行；1982年的 The Number of the Beast 是其早期重要作品[E1]。",
        "rewritten_question": null,
        "sql": "SELECT \"artist\".\"artist_id\", \"artist\".\"name\" AS \"artist_name\", SUM(\"invoice_line\".\"unit_price\" * \"invoice_line\".\"quantity\") AS \"sales_amount\" FROM \"public\".\"invoice_line\" INNER JOIN \"public\".\"invoice\" ON \"invoice\".\"invoice_id\" = \"invoice_line\".\"invoice_id\" INNER JOIN \"public\".\"track\" ON \"track\".\"track_id\" = \"invoice_line\".\"track_id\" INNER JOIN \"public\".\"album\" ON \"album\".\"album_id\" = \"track\".\"album_id\" INNER JOIN \"public\".\"artist\" ON \"artist\".\"artist_id\" = \"album\".\"artist_id\" WHERE \"invoice\".\"invoice_date\" >= '2024-01-01' AND \"invoice\".\"invoice_date\" < '2025-01-01' GROUP BY \"artist\".\"artist_id\", \"artist\".\"name\" ORDER BY \"sales_amount\" DESC, \"artist\".\"artist_id\" ASC LIMIT 1",
